         <div type="edition" xml:lang="pra-Latn" rendition="class:83225 maturity:83209">
             <p><lb n="1"/>bhojakasa mugurakoṇhasa <space/> bhojikiniya kāmāya<lb n="2"/>lekhakaputasa <space/> <unclear>ka</unclear>ṇ<unclear>ha</unclear>koṭavasa</p>
         </div>
         <div type="apparatus">
             <p/>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" resp="part:vito part:anol">
             <p>Of the <foreign>bhojaka</foreign> Mugurakoṇha <supplied reason="explanation" cert="low">= Mudaka-kṛṣṇa, <quote>Kṛṣṇa the elder</quote></supplied>. Of the <foreign>bhojaka</foreign>-wife Kāmā.
Of the scribe-son Kaṇhakoṭava <supplied reason="explanation" cert="low">= Kṛṣṇa-koṭṭ-avan, <quote>given by Kṛṣṇa</quote></supplied>.</p>
         </div>
